OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly will return to debate
OL,4,Aconversion practice ban bill, as
OL,5,Asitting suspended
OL,6,
OL,7,FAssembly members have been debating a
OL,8,Fbill aimed at banning sexuality and
OL,9,Fgender conversion practices for the
OL,10,Ffirst time at Stormont.
OL,12,FIt contains provisions that could see a
OL,13,Ftwo-year jail sentence imposed on
OL,14,Fpeople who conduct conversion
OL,15,Fpractices.
OL,17,FThe sitting was suspended late on
OL,18,FTuesday due to running out of time and
OL,19,Fwill return for further debate on 22
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
