OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly will return to debate
OL,4,Aconversion practice ban bill, as
OL,5,Asitting suspended
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlliance's deputy leader Eoin Tennyson
OL,8,Fproposed the private member's
OL,9,Flegislation, but it has been criticised
OL,10,Fby the Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,11,Fwhich said the bill "presents a real
OL,12,Fthreat to freedom".
